潔最不OK的那個。\n不論是玻璃還是桌面角落的灰。\n\n之前有光顧過其他家無人泡麵店，是智能機器櫃的，價格比較沒那麼貴，但環境是整潔的。\n\n然後這家滿滿警告標示，再加上滿滿便利貼，整個環境很凌亂，覺得整體設計要再加強。\n\n整潔沒很OK 整體視覺凌亂\n帶著滿滿的期待去，但結果覺得蠻失望的 🥲",null,[0,69]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTVDFSVWJEQlNNMDVFVFZkV01sSnRlRlpqTTBwelVrVjRiRTlZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTVDFSVWJEQlNNMDVFVFZkV01sSnRlRlpqTTBwelVrVjRiRTlZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTVDFSVWJEQlNNMDVFVFZkV01sSnRlRlpqTTBwelVrVjRiRTlZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTVDFSVWJEQlNNMDVFVFZkV01sSnRlRlpqTTBwelVrVjRiRTlZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTVDFSVWJEQlNNMDVFVFZkV01sSnRlRlpqTTBwelVrVjRiRTlZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTVDFSVWJEQlNNMDVFVFZkV01sSnRlRlpqTTBwelVrVjRiRTlZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,2013,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pST1RUbDBSM05ETVdWMlJteFZjM0pzUkV4bE9YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7f1557d12fa9e33e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjROTTl0R3NDMWV2RmxVc3JsRExlOXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pST1RUbDBSM05ETVdWMlJteFZjM0pzUkV4bE9YYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pST1RUbDBSM05ETVdWMlJteFZjM0pzUkV4bE9YYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pST1RUbDBSM05ETVdWMlJteFZjM0pzUkV4bE9YYxILMGRpTUh3dkJ6VmUaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qUk9UVGwwUjNORE1XVjJSbXhWYzNKc1JFeGxPWGMSCzBkaU1I