KEwiE68KsxtKWAxWqm68BHXEcM1IQ3IcHCOUBKBQ",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["📝有趣、方便的24小時拉麵店\n\n價格相較於自己買來煮，當然比較高，但便利在有額外加料區，也不用自己處理吃飽後的垃圾或碗筷，對於懶人來說算是便利的地方，24小時營業對於夜貓子也很方便！\n\n🖊️先挑選泡麵，記住泡麵號碼再去自助點餐機點選號碼等做結帳。\n🖊️記得看一下泡麵哪些調味要先加，不要一股腦一次處理完，乾麵調味包是煮完才加！\n🖊️煮的過程時時攪拌，避免水滾溢出或是底部燒焦。\n\n▫️二樓有化妝間可以使用\n\n▪️有些泡麵缺貨，不一定能吃到想吃的泡麵。",null,[0,91]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkViWE55VmpKM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkViWE55VmpKM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkViWE55VmpKM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkViWE55VmpKM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkViWE55VmpKM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkViWE55VmpKM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,8936,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREbXNyVjJ3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7f1557d12fa9e33e!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDDmsrV2wE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREbXNyVjJ3RRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREbXNyVjJ3RRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREbXNyVk93EhNDZ3dJb0pIT3NBWVFzTHVma1FJGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRERtc3JWdXdFEhNDZ3dJb0pIT3NBWVFzTHVma1FJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARPuOpL9FXFX8qCzBhM3NYVlg4eHFr\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiE68KsxtKWAxWqm68BHXEcM1IQoykI5gEoFQ"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],