蠻多的，但一碗泡麵連配料飲料加一加要160-180元，吃完還有點空虛，我以後還是自己在家煮就好。",null,[0,185]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkbkkyTUVobkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkbkkyTUVobkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkbkkyTUVobkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkbkkyTUVobkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkbkkyTUVobkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15829066980967673601/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUjZkbkkyTUVobkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,13206,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6dnI2MEhnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x7f1557d12fa9e33e!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDzvr60Hg%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6dnI2MEhnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6dnI2MEhnEi0KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRHp2cjYwbmdFEhJDZ3NJMU02YnN3WVFnSjM3TlEaLAoWQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUNBZ0lEenZyNjBYZxISQ2dzSTFNNmJzd1lRZ0ozN05RIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARPuOpL9FXFX8qCzBhT2lTSjVqZ3Ut\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiE68KsxtKWAxWqm68BHXEcM1IQoykI0AIoGw"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjhhsmsxtKWAxUgeF4EHd5_HfIQ0pMFCNcBKAc"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiE68KsxtKWAxWqm68BHXEcM1IQ0pMFCJ0CKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_posts__and__hotel_and_vr_partner_review_posts",null,"CjEIARIpCgoAP7_LAf7C____EhB9XODdUbAKN3nvEmcAAAAAGgn92T0Cb_4IX24YACIA"]],null,null,null,[3,1,null,null,null,[2]],["顧客表示，這家自助式拉麵店提供多種泡麵和新鮮食材，讓他們可以自由搭配。他們特別提到店內環境乾淨